# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if having platform-specific dependencies or dependencies
#   having no cross-platform support, conflicts can arise.
#   A good practice is to add Pipfile.lock to .gitignore file with a note here explaining why.
#   So, before adding Pipfile.lock to .gitignore, do a check if all dependencies are cross-platform.
#Pipfile.lock

